==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|tólf}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*twalif}}. Compare Faroese {{m|fo|tólv}}, Norwegian, Swedish, and Danish {{m|no|tolv}}.

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[twelve]]; the cardinal number after {{m|is|ellefu||eleven}} and before {{m|is|þrettán||thirteen}}.

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[tólfti]] {{g|m}}, [[tólfta]] {{g|f|n}}

